e-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dcd39f2c-eba1-44c3-91c6-bb799a26a96f\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-561302ef-91e3-4e30-b705-0d38ed329738\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-811882df-af99-422b-9e1c-46176b273aef\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-67f881e4-c7ce-4e52-a76b-310ae1453ee7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-15f92371-5e72-40c2-89f9-20ad0f86d488\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cc348bfb-cae4-447c-9629-d14087ff540e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-645d2f7d-b340-447a-aabe-d3131cd8fd94\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-06562b88-c08a-4993-86b4-fdd8126740a9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-40891e38-5790-45d7-915e-318fb83858c9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa51c959-ef11-4aa5-a13c-3a659f4f2ebe\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0284442d-5b5d-4238-9118-8483b9271ac3\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-270b6e0b-7028-4817-849f-f2f642787090\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e0b5acd1-d9e9-4c44-884f-da11fe90ebaa\"><b>📢 3월 31일(월) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c22b0724-140e-4d38-a4f0-ac7ec430cf5a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e2145e59-bb57-4109-b87b-d1ee8ed232b9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f832865b-2169-4210-8249-070f3b3d532d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-106b272a-183f-4adb-b1ff-2e5c691de19c\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27842bbe-94ef-43fb-affb-6ed1881d6b08\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5bc41495-4d8e-497a-a07b-34d2f83bb1d3\">- 3/31(월) 15:00 ~ 17:00 경​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-980a7273-7287-45c8-9fca-96d9f4bdf617\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-99ee1d77-eefd-4b1b-b77c-24c774ed5ca4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-39323ff3-4826-4d24-bcd8-a62dbdfc6bb0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0ecdf2a2-7bfe-4fd8-aa11-9ed79e0da541\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c26d1ab4-adbe-48d2-b333-22814d89384e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bcb98563-ce1d-4f8d-ba36-ce5ee3648aa4\">1.독일어, 태국어, 프랑스어 환경에서 브래디 스킬2 「페이버릿 캔디」의 일부 효과 설명이 잘못 표기된 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2102d828-2441-44f7-af90-c2eb121b3b11\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-daa882a2-3409-45b3-8f80-903de9b25b19\">2.일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38b4c1c8-92f8-4a99-b4f2-09f8eb980d90\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5240dfd5-80e7-4975-854c-7113ec5ac812\">3.에이드 코스튬 &#x27;메이드 인 스프링&#x27;의 전투 모션 중 특정 부위를 좀 더 자연스럽게 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c4815755-5230-494f-a9e5-0fe72d797760\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-55cb0d46-ad71-4142-916f-22492758ffb1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dfb904be-526c-402d-9970-b102085776b5\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ccedc752-35dd-4714-8e19-2056502e6f63\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4eb3e2e7-ae2e-4169-abdf-7bf51fbb06d6\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8b07dbbb-eed6-4f80-817d-3e6a3bde797c\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-997a0086-91c6-4401-b0c1-aa6588c03554\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bfcd2cf8-8267-400c-a3a6-674c8971ddc4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b8034a0-a699-47a2-9bf4-c61e901cb723\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-11813af4-47ac-4d98-8213-b174c5c4d33c\">·····················································································​​​</span></p><!-